        "text": "=Generate a comprehensive AI Workforce Audit based on the following analysis:\n\nFounder Signal: {{ $json.founder_signal }}\nPain Category: {{ $json.pain_category }}\nAI Employee Fit: {{ $json.ai_employee_fit }}\nMonthly Hours Saved: {{ $json.hours_saved }}\nMonthly Cost Savings: ${{ $json.cost_savings }}\nLead Score: {{ $json.lead_score }}\nReasoning: {{ $json.reasoning }}\n\nCreate a detailed audit containing:\n1. Executive Summary\n2. Pain Analysis\n3. Recommended AI Employee\n4. Estimated Monthly Savings\n5. Estimated Annual Savings (Monthly × 12)\n6. Implementation Roadmap\n7. ROI Summary\n\nFormat the audit professionally with clear sections and actionable insights.",
